00:51:56.000 --> 00:52:27.000
that's okay. You're still my best friend. And I still love you. And for him to respond that way. For somebody to tell me they loved me when I told them that was unlike anything I could have ever asked for. It was like a relief valve. And I still couldn't tell most people, but it was like this constant weight that had been building on me suddenly

