00:52:27.000 --> 00:52:59.000
lived a little bit. For as long as our friendship went on, he just asked questions and nobody had, and I'd never had anybody that I could tell things to. I'd never wanted to tell anybody anything. I'd never expected anybody to ask me questions. I could never have known what it would feel like for that to have that kind of friendship. Chewie went off to college. He and Spencer slowly drifted apart as high school friends often do.

